   "module_16049493631818": {
    "body": {
     "hs_enable_module_padding": true,
     "hs_wrapper_css": {
      "padding-bottom": "20px",
      "padding-left": "20px",
      "padding-right": "20px",
      "padding-top": "25px"
     },
     "html": "<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #000000;\">Hi {{ contact.firstname }},</span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">The process of developing your private label brand can be tiresome, and many private labelers make the process more difficult than it needs to be.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">So what can you do to make sure this process is simple? <a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/blog/how-physicians-can-get-better-private-labeling-for-supplements\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #6ca439;\">Read, How Physicians Can Get Better Supplements for Private Labeling&nbsp;</span></a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">We put together a blog detailing 5 essential tips that will make private labeling supplements that much easier.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: #666666;\">In this blog, we cover the importance of:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">Knowing what supplements you want to order</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">Asking the right questions</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">Planning your design</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">Knowing your distribution strategy</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">Avoiding reluctant private labelers</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Finding a partner that aligns with your business's core values is essential to building your brand, and we've got the resources to guide you to success.</p>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
